{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-EXERCISE-252XB","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-HINT-252XB-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 252Xb","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-SEG-252XB","semantic_anchor":"252Xb","source_anchor":"252Xb","source_line_start":1382,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"b2b676c347c8099d6d8df5a91b5beb57a1f202172f9ccce91b426f4be53e74e8","source_text":"find two expressions for\n$(\\mu_f\\times\\mu_g)\\{(x,y):a\\le x<y\\le b\\}$.","target_line_start":1415,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"95ee33e3783d0e80f393850cdda5065231860c34ef3ea1412670ac93030ef5c7","target_text":"temukan dua ungkapan untuk\n$(\\mu_f\\times\\mu_g)\\{(x,y):a\\le x<y\\le b\\}$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-EXERCISE-252XC","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-HINT-252XC-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 252Xc","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-SEG-252XC","semantic_anchor":"252Xc","source_anchor":"252Xc","source_line_start":1392,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"80090ea7730247be2fd062db439e07ac86f6f49da317f97406f5bf3f6ace2049","source_text":"if $B$ is not negligible and $A\\times B\\in\\Lambda$, take $H$ such\nthat $\\nu H<\\infty$ and $B\\cap H$ is not negligible.   Then\n$W=A\\times(B\\cap H)$ is measured by $\\mu\\times\\nu_H$, where $\\nu_H$ is\nthe subspace measure on $H$.   Now apply 252D to $\\mu$, $\\nu_H$ and $W$\nto see that $A\\in\\Sigma$.","target_line_start":1425,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"d99b579789f4f91ee358d80375e13980f9b2e3d944b01767c98623ee3af0ba42","target_text":"jika $B$ tidak terabaikan dan $A\\times B\\in\\Lambda$, ambil $H$ sedemikian\nsehingga $\\nu H<\\infty$ dan $B\\cap H$ tidak terabaikan. Maka\n$W=A\\times(B\\cap H)$ diukur oleh $\\mu\\times\\nu_H$, dengan $\\nu_H$ merupakan\nukuran subruang pada $H$. Sekarang terapkan 252D pada $\\mu$, $\\nu_H$ dan $W$\nuntuk melihat bahwa $A\\in\\Sigma$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-EXERCISE-252XE","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-HINT-252XE-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 252Xe","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-SEG-252XE","semantic_anchor":"252Xe","source_anchor":"252Xe","source_line_start":1413,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"b5e6416d45c58bd9ce325ca92e712f9d3a69ae2f7de8995c0783199c9e24e724","source_text":"in\n252Kb, try $Y$ a proper subset of $[0,1]$.","target_line_start":1447,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"d6e9a946ee70b8fa8018417fe200419ce047e8e5763750309c7bf6519c4c8abb","target_text":"dalam 252Kb, coba ambil $Y$ sebagai subhimpunan sejati dari $[0,1]$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-EXERCISE-252YC","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-HINT-252YC-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 252Yc","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252-SEG-252YC","semantic_anchor":"252Yc","source_anchor":"252Yc","source_line_start":1488,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"ad4a0bdd0a9d7349b0d019f7f78259c2f80609c01c11b2c286070f185a6051e5","source_text":"show that there\nare sequences $\\sequencen{G_n}$, $\\sequencen{H_n}$ of sets of finite\nmeasure such that $f(x,y)$ is defined and equal to $0$ for every\n$(x,y)\\in(X\\times Y)\\setminus\\bigcup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}G_n\\times H_n$.","target_line_start":1524,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"4d7fba08698d91db9a677f639df5a2b4e1e5f2e848c09b87b96ff3afff53223d","target_text":"tunjukkan bahwa terdapat\nbarisan-barisan $\\sequencen{G_n}$, $\\sequencen{H_n}$ dari himpunan-himpunan\nberukuran hingga sedemikian sehingga $f(x,y)$ terdefinisi dan sama dengan $0$\nuntuk setiap\n$(x,y)\\in(X\\times Y)\\setminus\\bigcup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}G_n\\times H_n$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S252"}
